@page "/docs/components/command"

<DocsPage Title="Command" Description="Command menu for search and quick actions.">
    <ComponentPreview Name="command-demo" Align="start" PreviewClass="h-[24.5rem]" />
    <DocsHeading Title="About" />
    <p>The <code>Command</code> component is a port of <a href="https://github.com/dip/cmdk">cmdk</a> by <a href="https://www.dip.org/">Dip</a>: the same fuzzy filtering, ranking and keyboard navigation, with no JavaScript dependency.</p>
    <DocsHeading Title="Installation" />
    <InstallationTabs Name="command" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Usage" />
    <CodeFigure Code="@UsageCode" LineNumbers="true" />
    <p>To open the menu with <kbd>⌘K</kbd> (<kbd>Ctrl+K</kbd> on Windows and Linux), put it in a <code>CommandDialog</code> and toggle it with a <code>KeyboardShortcut</code>. <code>OnSelect</code> passes the selected item&apos;s value: close the dialog, then run the command it names.</p>
    <CodeFigure Code="@DialogCode" LineNumbers="true" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Composition" />
    <p>Use the following composition to build a <code>Command</code>:</p>
    <CodeFigure Code="@CompositionCode" Language="text" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Basic" />
    <p>A simple command menu in a dialog.</p>
    <ComponentPreview Name="command-basic" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Shortcuts" />
    <ComponentPreview Name="command-shortcuts" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Groups" />
    <p>A command menu with groups, icons and separators.</p>
    <ComponentPreview Name="command-groups" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Scrollable" />
    <p>Scrollable command menu with multiple items.</p>
    <ComponentPreview Name="command-scrollable" />
    <DocsHeading Title="RTL" />
    <p>To enable RTL support in Blazix, see the <a href="/docs/rtl">RTL configuration guide</a>.</p>
    <ComponentPreview Name="command-rtl" Direction="rtl" PreviewClass="h-auto" />
    <DocsHeading Title="API Reference" />
    <ApiReference Name="command" />
</DocsPage>

@code {
    private const string UsageCode = """
        <Command Class="max-w-sm rounded-lg border">
            <CommandInput placeholder="Type a command or search..." />
            <CommandList>
                <CommandEmpty>No results found.</CommandEmpty>
                <CommandGroup Heading="Suggestions">
                    <CommandItem>Calendar</CommandItem>
                    <CommandItem>Search Emoji</CommandItem>
                    <CommandItem>Calculator</CommandItem>
                </CommandGroup>
                <CommandSeparator />
                <CommandGroup Heading="Settings">
                    <CommandItem>Profile</CommandItem>
                    <CommandItem>Billing</CommandItem>
                    <CommandItem>Settings</CommandItem>
                </CommandGroup>
            </CommandList>
        </Command>
        """;

    private const string DialogCode = """
        <KeyboardShortcut Key="k" OnPressed="() => _open = !_open" />
        <CommandDialog @bind-Open="_open">
            <Command>
                <CommandInput placeholder="Type a command or search..." />
                <CommandList>
                    <CommandEmpty>No results found.</CommandEmpty>
                    <CommandGroup Heading="Suggestions">
                        <CommandItem OnSelect="RunCommand">Calendar</CommandItem>
                        <CommandItem OnSelect="RunCommand">Search Emoji</CommandItem>
                        <CommandItem OnSelect="RunCommand">Calculator</CommandItem>
                    </CommandGroup>
                </CommandList>
            </Command>
        </CommandDialog>

        @code {
            private bool _open;

            private void RunCommand(string value)
            {
                _open = false;
            }
        }
        """;

    private const string CompositionCode = """
        Command
        ├── CommandInput
        └── CommandList
            ├── CommandEmpty
            ├── CommandGroup
            │   ├── CommandItem
            │   └── CommandItem
            ├── CommandSeparator
            └── CommandGroup
                ├── CommandItem
                └── CommandItem
        """;
}